 "helius_rps_na_paket": 0,
 "zachem": "p.1 standarta vyborki 10.10: podnyat 30 sutok istorii pod pereschyot istochnikov. Proba glubiny arhiva: chasy est nazad do 2026/05/24 (120 sutok ot 21.09), na 180 sutkah uzhe 404; chas vesit 0.467 GB, chtenie 20.8 MB/s, to est 11.2 GB i 9 minut na sutki, 336 GB i 4.5 chasa na 30 sutok, 673 GB i 9 chasov na 60. Gigabayty -- prokachat, a ne hranit: prohod potochnyy, na diske ostayutsya tolko sutochnye fayly. Sobirayutsya sutki 2026-08-22 .. 2026-09-20 -- rovno te, chto lezhat PERED moimi 18 sutkami (21.09..08.10), temi zhe parametrami, chto i prezhnie paket_* fayly: porog signala 2 SOL, okno 160 slotov, bilety 0.1 i 0.3, okno dokupki 1800, pered 10. Dobavleno --vselennaya 20: v tom zhe prohode pishutsya koshelki vselennoy s ne menee 20 pervymi pokupkami ot 2 SOL (modeli u nih net, eto spisok kandidatov pod otdelnyy pricelnyy prohod). Vyhody 36/60/108 i vhody S0_dno/S1/S2 u etoy formy fayla uzhe est -- imenno oni nuzhny standartu. 30 zadaniy idut po 6 odnovremenno, kak velit potolok vladelca. Tolko chtenie arhiva. Povtor: pervyy progon etogo markera (38052851920) byl otmenyon pushem sleduyuschego markera -- u gruppy concurrency s cancel-in-progress false GitHub derzhit tolko odin ozhidayuschiy progon, i novyy push snimaet prezhniy. Poetomu oba markera glubiny idut odnim kommitom i odnim prohodom."
